es and 6 weapon classes, build your own playstyle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tEnemies come in waves \u2014 each wave lasts 20 to 90 seconds. Survive and take down as many enemies as you can!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Robust meta progression</strong> \u2014 earn rewards during gameplay to upgrade your tanks and even unlock hidden powers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Backpack management \u2014</strong> maximize your gear\u2019s potential!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Deep strategy and skill-based gameplay</strong> \u2014master the core mechanics, and you\u2019ll crush your way to victory with precise controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Brotank is a bullet-hell roguelike game. You play as a bounty hunter driving a tank through a post-apocalyptic wasteland\u2014rescuing allies, upgrading gear, customizing your war machine, surviving relentless enemy waves, and ultimately becoming a legend!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029570/0ef128d337d04deec72bdbddc4e7cc7cddc63ca9/header.jpg?t=1778378677", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Top-Down Shooter", "Roguelite", "Retro", "Bullet Hell", "Indie"], "developers": "Dfirend Games", "publishers": "Dfirend Games", "release_date": "Mar 5, 2026", "price": "$4.99", "appid": "3029570", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "6 January 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/MF_B5FufMXs", "first_seen": 1767657600.0, "review_rank": 1385}